WEBVTT

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:38.610
Restaurant Bamboo.

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:41.610
The waitress working from 5pm
each Thursday is really cute!

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:43.510
All right, come in.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:48.990
There's no doubt.

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:50.460
Let's break in.

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:53.260
Are we really gonna do this, Megumi?

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:54.930
Why don't we talk to them first?

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:55.830
That won't be enough!

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:59.060
Depending on how they wanna handle
this, we might have to use your Personas!

00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:01.170
Hey now!

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:05.010
We're talking about a group of kids
regularly abusing Shadow Extraction.

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:10.030
We better catch their leader,
Mori, and put them in their place!

00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:12.840
What do you think?

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:16.810
Oh boy.

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:18.720
Where is Mori!?

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:23.090
I have the advantage!

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:35.000
I want more!

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:37.300
Kanaru!

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:41.300
Why'd you stop?

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:01.700
kanjouni aragau nayo
Don't fight back your emotions

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:04.030
sono ashiwo tomenna
Don't ever stop

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:07.990
taoreru nowa mada hayaize
It's too soon to fall down

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:10.140
Breakin' through
Breakin' through

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:11.970
uchinukeyo
Pierce through

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:14.280
yamiwo hurihodoki
Free yourself from darkness

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:18.230
tadoritsuku bashowa hitotsusa
There is only one destination

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:22.550
hurueru sora
Quaking sky

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:28.220
kazewa naniwo tsugeru
What is the wind telling me?

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:34.030
tadashii datoka soujanai toka
Right or wrong

00:02:34.030 --> 00:02:37.070
kudaranai ronsouwa
Nonsensical arguments

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:39.730
kieya shinai kedo
Never go away

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:44.240
shinjita kotowo shinjinuku koto
Believe what you believe in

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:47.310
sono sakini bokurawa
At the end of it all

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.840
hikari mitsukeru darou
We will find the light

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:55.020
saa tokihanate ima
Now is the time to release it

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:57.990
kanjouni aragau nayo
Don't fight back your emotions

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:00.220
sono ashiwo tomenna
Don't ever stop

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:04.250
taoreru nowa mada hayaize
It's too soon to fall down

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:06.430
Breakin' through
Breakin' through

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:08.130
uchinukeyo
Pierce through

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:10.400
yamiwo hurihodoki
Free yourself from darkness

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:14.270
tadoritsuku bashowa hitotsusa
There is only one destination

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:30.750
I couldn't control myself...

00:03:32.050 --> 00:03:35.220
I vowed to myself this was gonna be the last time...

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:38.560
I was really gonna stop after that one time...

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:41.860
But...

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:49.300
Our friendship is over the next time you do it.

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:55.440
Megumi, why do you get so upset about it?

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:59.250
I know too much isn't good, but
it's fine to relax once in a while.

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:01.620
Once in a while? Relax?

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:05.320
Did she look like she was just "relaxing" earlier?

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:08.290
W-well, of course, that was a little different...

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:11.160
Forming a secret club and doing it
with a bunch of random people?

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:12.890
Honestly, it's beyond abnormal!

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:20.300
I'm... sorry...

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:23.530
Kanaru...

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:28.110
Yes, that's right.

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:29.800
Yes... yes...

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:33.850
8 o'clock at Bamboo, near
the highway, right? ...Sure.

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.980
I'm going home now.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:40.350
Wait a second!

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:43.890
What was that call about?

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:47.160
That was a Shadow Extraction invite...

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:55.270
Kanaru!

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:13.220
I turned down their offer.

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:16.850
So there are people outside of school you
perform Shadow Extraction with, too?

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:18.690
Yes...

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:19.960
Why?

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.560
Kayano is very worried about you...

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:24.220
I'm aware of that...

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:27.540
Sometimes, I realize I'm standing
in the middle of an unfamiliar place.

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:31.410
Or wake up in my bed, even though
I don't remember going to sleep.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:33.400
These things keep happening to me...

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:37.180
Sorry about the interruption earlier.
Let's meet somewhere else now!

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:41.010
Oh, it's from my mother.

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:48.560
You should really stop.

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:52.460
It might not be related at all, but
when I first transferred to the school,

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:56.200
there were a bunch of kids who went missing...

00:05:56.200 --> 00:06:00.460
I know... They were all good at Shadow Extraction.

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:03.340
I had them do it to me, too.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:08.800
Sakakiba-kun's friend, Okazaki-kun,
and Tasaka Yumi-senpai, too...

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:17.120
I'm getting off here.

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:18.890
You live around here?

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:21.960
No, I need to go to a store...

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:23.650
I see...

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.060
Kanzato-kun, this...

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:28.200
Good Health
Kanzato-kun, this...

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:29.130
Good Health

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:34.400
Mayuri-chan gave it to me, and I
had forgotten to give it back to you.

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:36.040
See you...

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.230
Morimoto.

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:42.140
You're not going to go see the kids from
the Shadow Extraction Circle, are you?

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:44.740
No.

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:52.220
Mori-san.

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:57.890
Ryo-niichan said he's gonna be late tonight again.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:01.450
Should I make some eggs?
We didn't have breakfast.

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:05.590
Shin-niichan?

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:13.360
Niichan?

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.310
Welcome!

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:20.780
I had them all leave.

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:24.450
Kanzato-kun...

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:27.560
I told them to never approach you again.

00:07:27.560 --> 00:07:30.460
He got punched.

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:31.790
I-I'm so-!

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:35.350
You met up with the kids
from the circle earlier, right?

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:41.000
I won't tell Kayano about it, so
you should really quit this time.

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:44.100
Can you make a promise?

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.320
What happened to you?

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:01.290
Nothing...

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:04.630
Hey, is this?

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:06.090
Hey, stop.

00:08:07.060 --> 00:08:08.260
Shin, did you get punched?

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:10.360
Kanaru!

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:14.270
Instead of ending our friendship,
change your contact info now.

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:23.370
Change your settings so every one of your
Shadow Extraction friends are blocked.

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:26.050
I didn't...

00:08:26.050 --> 00:08:28.380
I told Megumi-san.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:29.580
Jun...

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:31.950
I thought that would've been better.

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:37.660
Crap, it's Kayano.

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:38.890
It's Kayano Megumi!

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:41.100
Those guys!

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:42.000
Wait!

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:42.960
What!?

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:44.960
Rather than that, you should...

00:08:48.740 --> 00:08:51.210
This isn't working at all.

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.440
Then what should we do?

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:59.100
There.

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:03.180
Jun, make sure to watch the house.

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:05.150
Niichan, hurry.

00:09:07.390 --> 00:09:08.490
You!

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:11.480
I'm concerned about her.

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:13.220
What?

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:18.130
It doesn't mean I like older girls, okay?

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:30.180
Sorry I was so harsh on you.

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:32.680
I've... done it before, too.

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:33.950
Shadow Extraction.

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:37.410
I was messing around during dance practice.

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:41.580
I watched Yumi-senpai do it
and I did it to someone else.

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:47.330
The girl couldn't come to
school for a while after that.

00:09:48.430 --> 00:09:50.190
It's a really dangerous activity...

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:52.460
Yes...

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:57.970
But... I know you can quit.

00:09:58.210 --> 00:10:00.640
So do your best.

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:02.170
Megumi-san...

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.740
Anyone who can Shadow Extract me now.

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:30.900
Sending.

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:39.840
I'm sorry...

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:02.700
Morimoto...

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:11.010
Kanzato-kun.

00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:13.480
Please, I need...

00:11:23.560 --> 00:11:27.550
Do you want me to do it just once, Morimoto?

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:29.260
Takuro...

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:32.320
She's definitely dependent on it.

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:36.060
Shadow Extraction addiction...

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:41.540
I've seen a few people who couldn't
quit, but they were nothing like this.

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:43.180
This is horrible.

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:44.410
Kanaru!

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:48.780
Kanaru, are you all right!?

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:51.240
Y-yes...

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:56.590
I know. You don't have to say anything.

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:01.350
I want to be with everyone.

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:09.030
Don't worry... We're not gonna go anywhere.

00:12:13.410 --> 00:12:15.880
Do you guys wanna come to my room?

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:17.570
It must be chilly out here.

00:12:27.150 --> 00:12:30.490
Kanaru-chan, people are calling you Mori now?

00:12:30.490 --> 00:12:33.960
Yes... The kids from the circle started to...

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:38.770
I heard whoever started the Shadow
Extraction trend here was called Mori, too.

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:39.830
What?

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:42.360
They must be into it deep, too,

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:45.010
if they're calling Kanaru by the
name of someone like that.

00:12:45.010 --> 00:12:48.080
It's probably just because her name is Morimoto.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:50.770
Though, just because of that one person...

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:33.610
Persona user?

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:36.360
Right.

00:13:36.360 --> 00:13:41.490
That person is probably a Persona user like
you guys with equal, or greater, abilities.

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:46.660
It must be amazing to do it with that person...

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:54.340
By the way, Inui-san, how do
you know we're Persona users?

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:56.910
Huh? Well, during our trip, you all were...

00:13:56.910 --> 00:14:00.410
You were watching? I mean,
why aren't you surprised?

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:04.850
I grew up surrounded by
Persona users for a little while.

00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:10.420
Were there a lot of Persona users a long time ago?

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:13.090
It wasn't that long ago, really.

00:14:13.590 --> 00:14:17.160
I think they've been declining
over the past ten years.

00:14:18.030 --> 00:14:20.020
Just a warning...

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:23.830
Shadow Extraction's effects are
related to the power of your Persona.

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:25.910
Did you hear that?

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:27.200
What?

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:32.070
So, don't ask any of us to do
it to you, okay, Kanaru-chan?

00:14:32.310 --> 00:14:33.610
Is that true?

00:14:33.610 --> 00:14:36.880
Inui-san! Don't say anything to provoke her!

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:38.390
Oops, sorry.

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:40.180
You seem to know a lot.

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:43.690
Yup.

00:14:43.890 --> 00:14:47.260
What are Personas, anyway?

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:47.800
They're...

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:52.270
A Persona is your other self,
hiding deep within your mind.

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:56.100
It's an incarnation of your psyche,
plus another special ability.

00:14:58.410 --> 00:14:59.390
What's that?

00:14:59.740 --> 00:15:00.930
Kanaru!?

00:15:03.180 --> 00:15:06.310
Did I just say something?

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:09.950
Oh, c'mon, give me a break.

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:12.820
We can't leave her alone like this.

00:15:12.820 --> 00:15:14.340
You're right...

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:38.540
We'll always be together.
Do your best! - Megumi

00:15:47.490 --> 00:15:51.160
Kanaru-chan just left with some guys.

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:52.390
What!?

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:55.530
I heard you're all sticking by
her side day in and day out.

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:58.100
Shadow Extraction sounds really scary.

00:15:58.100 --> 00:15:59.870
Do you know where she went?

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:01.040
What? I'm not sure...

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:03.770
She might have gone to do
Shadow Extraction again.

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:04.970
Oh...

00:16:04.970 --> 00:16:07.410
She was doing so well!

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:17.790
Mori-san, that wasn't cool.

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:21.740
Last time, you went home before letting me do it.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:27.420
I went to see you after I read your
late-night forum post, but you didn't come.

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:29.650
I'm sorry...

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:37.840
Is there a new member?

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:39.900
Ishibashi-kun is going to get him right now.

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:04.760
Persona?

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:16.630
We're done... Morimoto.

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:35.500
This is a nice house. Where are your parents?

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:37.860
They should be back soon.

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:45.500
You aren't having sleepovers
with your friends anymore?

00:17:50.410 --> 00:17:52.610
Looks like you've betrayed them.

00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:55.980
You might break it if you strain yourself too much.

00:17:57.820 --> 00:17:59.450
Your heart.

00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:04.220
If there's something that can make
things easier, why not give in for a little?

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:09.990
Do you want me to do something amazing?

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:13.660
Relax...

00:18:15.040 --> 00:18:16.700
Close your eyes.

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:22.570
No!

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:25.950
What's wrong?

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:28.470
No... No!

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.660
Good Health

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:51.310
Kanzato-kun...

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:54.680
Morimoto's house is around here, right?

00:18:54.680 --> 00:18:55.580
Sure.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:57.540
But she's gone now.

00:18:57.540 --> 00:18:58.510
What?

00:19:00.980 --> 00:19:03.920
Kanzato-kun? What are you up to?

00:19:03.920 --> 00:19:07.320
Where are you? Are you with Kanaru?

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:08.720
What?

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:11.780
I'll call you back if I find her.

00:19:13.190 --> 00:19:17.150
Is there a park around here?

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:35.670
There was a yard like this at our orphanage.

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:42.190
When we were sad or upset, we would
hide inside those things and secretly cry.

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:58.700
Stay away!

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:03.040
Stay away... please.

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:05.380
Morimoto.

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:09.210
I don't want anyone to see me like this...

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:16.020
Good Health

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:18.490
I'll be waiting outside.

00:20:30.900 --> 00:20:31.670
Morimoto!

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:35.080
Morimoto!

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:36.010
No! Don't get near me!

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:37.570
Wait! I said, wait!

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:41.950
Don't look at me... please. Don't look!

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:46.010
Morimoto!

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:50.280
Get a hold of yourself!

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:55.930
You can do it!

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:57.690
Morimoto, you can overcome this!

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:14.880
H-hey!

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:16.410
What... is that?

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:33.000
U-um...

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:35.870
What's that up there?

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:53.290
omotai kusariwo
The heavy chain

00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:59.490
ima hazushite agemashou
I will take it off for you

00:21:59.490 --> 00:22:04.400
jiyuuni naretara
Once you're free

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:11.370
kokowo habataite yukeruwa
You'll be able to fly away

00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:17.950
atashiga samatage
I stood in your way

00:22:17.950 --> 00:22:26.580
ubatte kita madaminu sekai e
and took that world you haven't seen

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:31.160
tamerau nonara
If you're going to hesitate

00:22:31.160 --> 00:22:39.770
huriharatte ageru sono udewo
I will free that arm for you

00:22:39.770 --> 00:22:44.270
soshite tookue
Then to faraway

00:22:44.270 --> 00:22:50.380
dekirudake tookue
As far away as possible

00:22:50.380 --> 00:22:53.650
aishiteruno
"I love you"

00:22:53.650 --> 00:22:57.380
ikanaideyo
"Don't leave me"

00:22:57.380 --> 00:23:03.720
koware chaukara
I will break

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:16.300
Some things should never be violated.

00:23:16.300 --> 00:23:18.670
The lost nature.

00:23:18.670 --> 00:23:21.870
Sediments of the livelihood that cannot turn back.

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:25.180
The ripples spread to the sea of the psyche.

00:23:25.180 --> 00:23:27.810
Eventually shaking everything.

00:23:28.020 --> 00:23:31.780
The great gathering writhes in pain.

00:23:32.950 --> 00:23:35.720
The one who suffers in the inescapable gap.

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:38.780
Unaccepted loss of admonishment.

00:23:38.930 --> 00:23:41.420
A burdened soul of deep-rooted delusion.
